  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back on set, Muranishi scrapes together another million yen and urges the actress to show her true self. Days later, Kawada and Toshi return to the video shop to see how their bold new release is faring. Listen to Muranishi, Kawada, and the Manager in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あんなものを見せて損すんのはお前なんだから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ギャラはかき集めてもう百万積む。本当のお前を見せてみろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今、お前最高に輝いてるぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "オーケー、ファンタスティック！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "みく、すばらしかったぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ご苦労さん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "こんにちは。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "ああ、並んでるよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "一歩前進ですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "あんたらの作品さ、斬新で面白かったよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "でもそれ、ポセイドンの女優だろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "大丈夫なのか？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あんなものを見せて損すんのはお前なんだから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Showing half-baked work like that only hurts your own name.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ギャラはかき集めてもう百万積む。本当のお前を見せてみろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'll scrape together another million yen on top of your fee — show me the real you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今、お前最高に輝いてるぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right now, you are shining brighter than ever!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "オーケー、ファンタスティック！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Okay, fantastic!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "みく、すばらしかったぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Miku, you were magnificent.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ご苦労さん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good work today, everyone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "こんにちは。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good afternoon!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "ああ、並んでるよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, hello — your new tapes are lined up on the rack.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "一歩前進ですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is one solid step forward for us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "あんたらの作品さ、斬新で面白かったよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your new release was fresh and genuinely entertaining.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "でもそれ、ポセイドンの女優だろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, isn't that girl one of Poseidon's actresses?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "大丈夫なのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you sure you guys are going to be okay?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
